            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37933096?u=b11a857efbc669246eb43904472627625dcdbbdb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Automatic update generated by <a href=\"https://github.com/nix-community/nixpkgs-update\">nixpkgs-update</a> tools. This update was made based on information from passthru.updateScript.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">meta.description for ranger is: File manager with minimalistic curses interface</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">meta.homepage for ranger is: <a href=\"https://ranger.github.io/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ranger.github.io/</a></p>\n<h6 dir=\"auto\">Updates performed</h6>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Ran passthru.UpdateScript</li>\n</ul>\n<h6 dir=\"auto\">To inspect upstream changes</h6>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ranger/ranger/compare/6d5e0d8dc4cc5ddf53211e19f48c5b5e9ee47b18...6b646df44604fac6b7843119833a696789d6f3f3\">Compare changes on GitHub</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h6 dir=\"auto\">Impact</h6>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><b>Checks done</b></p>\n<hr>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>built on NixOS</li>\n<li>The tests defined in <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>, if any, passed</li>\n<li>found 1.9.3-unstable-2025-11-01 in filename of file in /nix/store/xbxab07qcydsckiwxpfyzzrxqrbkhaf1-ranger-1.9.3-unstable-2025-11-01</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<b>Rebuild report</b> (if merged into master) (click to expand)\n</summary>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"2 total rebuild path(s)\n\n2 package rebuild(s)\n\nFirst fifty rebuilds by attrpath\n\nranger\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">2 total rebuild path(s)\n\n2 package rebuild(s)\n\nFirst fifty rebuilds by attrpath\n\nranger\n</code></pre></div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<b>Instructions to test this update</b> (click to expand)\n</summary>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Either <strong>download from the